  - m_Id: 2497392309260288
    m_Localized: Eclipsera- Story mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2501568191877120
    m_Localized: Before the fragments... there was a seventh kingdom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2501916012924928
    m_Localized: A kingdom where everything coexisted. Until something arrived.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2502131805671424
    m_Localized: It didn't conquer. It didn't negotiate. It left no warnings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2502311519014912
    m_Localized: It just erased.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2502397154119680
    m_Localized: Among the fragments... something survived.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2502490200559616
    m_Localized: Or at least... something persisted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2502544860729344
    m_Localized: Your being was erased... but your mind persists.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2502790814715904
    m_Localized: I don't remember who I am. I don't remember where I come from. But
      I know one thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2503020293476352
    m_Localized: If I want answers... I must find them among the fragments.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2506907016581120
    m_Localized: You are still here. That is enough for now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507059697635328
    m_Localized: 'Do not try to remember everything at once. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2509534135668736
    m_Localized: Your time has not yet come
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3131746047840256
    m_Localized: Respawn at checkpoint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3171855161970688
    m_Localized: Your mind is not ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
